      "product_summary": "Mens winter ankle boots for B2B footwear assortments. Black and Gray each offered in EU39-48. A rotary dial closes the cord system and the photographs show a plush lining and collar, heel pull tab, stitched side panels and visible lugged outsole. TPR outsole is specified for this style. A widened toe box is specified for this model; measured width grades are not specified. Upper and midsole compositions are not specified; plush describes the lining texture without a fiber claim. Send color-size mix, pair quantity, packaging needs and destination for a wholesale quotation. Sample availability, branding feasibility, charges and dispatch timing require order-specific confirmation.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Share footwear specifications, quantities, packaging needs and destination for review and quotation. Company images introduce company activities and order coordination."
